---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import { site, wa } from '../site';
---
<Base title="Privacy policy" description="How Veylo Media collects and uses your personal data.">
  <PageHero title="Privacy policy" lede="Last updated 6 November 2026." />
  <section class="sec prose">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>This policy explains how Veylo Media ("we") handles personal data shared through this website, in line with India's Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023.</p>
      <h2 class="h3">What we collect</h2>
      <p>Only what you enter in our forms: your name, phone number, and optionally your email, company, city, the services you need and your message. We also record the page you sent it from and any campaign tags in the link.</p>
      <h2 class="h3">Why we collect it</h2>
      <p>To reply to your enquiry and discuss our services with you. We do not sell your data or use it for anything else.</p>
      <h2 class="h3">Where it is stored</h2>
      <p>Enquiries are stored in a private Google Sheet and sent to our team by email. Access is limited to people who need it to reply to you. We keep enquiries for up to 24 months unless you ask us to delete them sooner.</p>
      <h2 class="h3">Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete your data, or withdraw your consent, at any time by writing to {site.email ? <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> : <a href={wa('Hi Veylo, a request about my data.')}>us on WhatsApp</a>}. We'll respond within 30 days.</p>
      <h2 class="h3">Cookies</h2>
      <p>This website does not use tracking cookies. Our form uses Cloudflare Turnstile to block spam, which may process technical data about your browser.</p>
      <h2 class="h3">Who processes your data</h2>
      <p>Cloudflare hosts this website and checks the form for spam. Google stores enquiries in Google Sheets and delivers our alert emails through Gmail. Both act only on our instructions.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
<style>.prose h2 { margin: 40px 0 12px; }</style>
